Implemented the native SwiftUI/HIG parity of the web `TeslaOrdersPage` (route `/tesla-orders`) — **committed as `cb8848b93`**.

**What shipped** (the web page is a thin `PageContainer` wrapper around the already-shipped native `ActiveOrdersSection`; reproduced 1:1):
- **`TeslaOrdersPage.swift`** — adaptive macOS/iOS scaffold with page header (`TSPageTitle` + subtitle) embedding `ActiveOrdersSection(model:)`, bound to the `@Observable ActiveOrdersModel` (P1/S8). 4 `#if DEBUG` previews.
