- **`Localizable.xcstrings`** — added `route.teslaOrders`; **reused** existing `translation.orders.title`/`translation.orders.subtitle` (exact web values/keys).
- **Tests** + **apple-ledger.json** (+2 rows, 2/2) + **evidence log**.

